   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SANDEE is a regional network that seeks to strengthen capacity in the area of poverty, economic development and environmental change by strengthen the ability of researchers in South Asia to undertake policy relevant research, support the growth of rigorous  policy-relevant literature, support teaching/research insitutions and by facilitate dialoge among economist and others on environment</narrative>
